cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Smart Space Occupancy Monitoring
message: >-
  A four-model benchmark (detection, CNN regression, gradient boosting on deep
  features, density estimation) for indoor people-counting, with tracking-based
  flow counting, uncertainty-aware evaluation, and edge deployment tooling.
